    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Rani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103307118422990028795/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjIsy2rglJoVc-3ugkFg3U4m7mM1fsauJ0XIWy8wKRmvhQ8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Cindy Gamble at A Pro Peau Spa is a game-changer for our family of five! She's taken exceptional care of our pedicures, and I confidently say she's better than any Podiatrist we've ever met. Not only does she have a deep understanding of nail, foot and skin care, but she's also passionate about prevention and beautification. What truly sets Cindy apart is her special soul - she's a gifted healer with a warm and caring touch. She's also an amazing conversationalist who can effortlessly draw even the most reluctant teens (ahem, mine!) out of their shells. The quality of products she uses is top-notch, and her commitment to sterile sanitation is exceptional, putting our minds at ease. But this experience goes beyond just a medical pedicure - it's a relaxing, zen-like treatment that leaves you feeling pampered and spoiled. Cindy's hospitality is of the highest order, making you feel like royalty from the moment you step in. We've been lucky enough to experience her expertise and kindness firsthand, and have finally found a practitioner who ensures my family of 5 will always have happy, healthy, and beautiful feet. A Pro Peau Spa is a hidden gem 💎!",
        "time": 1749756414,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karina Geoffroy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107734405050087679322/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWAAbgG9Mgowyf2Z8RHp1U2YsFc_wqaduLVN294D7RmHMDNRf49=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "OMG, by far the best pedicures I've ever had.  Being an esthetic teacher, I am very picky on hygiene and quality of service. Cindy has the highest standards I have ever seen in a spa.  Her knowledge, professionalism and attention to details make a visit with her the highlight of my week!  PLUS, SHE OFFERS RECEIPTS FOR INSURANCE AND MY SERVICE IS REIMBURSED BY MY INSURANCE COMPANY.  Come for her expertise, come for her lattes, but come experience this unique spa were relaxation and incomparable results meet.  Thank you Cindy ❤️👣☁️",
        "time": 1750950223,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Debora Hume",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101348131582316800492/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKy1BXV6Q5B_xo8DwQTO2KPJ7klmvXe24v8Bpz14WEPbF8CRA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve had the most amazing treatments with Cindy. The highest quality manicures and pedicures I’ve ever had. She uses quality products and know what she’s doing. I’ve never had a manicure last without chipping for 1 month and more.\nI had booked an appointment in advance after my manicure and when I got there, she could see that my nails were still perfect and didn’t need doing. Most places would just take your money but Cindy is honest to a fault. Just love that about her.\nRecently, I had a hydra facial and 1 week later, my face still feels amazing.\nNot to mention the coffee and other treats she showers you with. This place is a beauty haven and Cindy is such a beautiful soul.\nYou will not regret booking an appointment with her.",
        "time": 1741977729,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "rhonda gold",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109728826045705899649/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZFahohaJxCUnpSwTh-CqRKFtT29Ed0EBJ5UdJRNbiLcr_iVxA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Spa day with cindy! ❤️ Never before cindy have I ever had such amazing treatments! My skin is glowing and my halloween nails are creeping!! Love you and all your amazing work xoxo",
        "time": 1697228722,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "marilou chenier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107463490933779368787/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIYsRNa6gSjJaaane9R0mX3XIcDFcNcE6QGvRnpcq515AMAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Always a great experience with Cindy! She takes care of you from head to toe and gives you the best quality service that you need. For years I have seen her for my facials and it has now been two times that I see her for Hydrafacials specifically and I must say I have always been extremely satisfied with each of her services, it is always personalized with what my skin needs: acne, acne scars, and/or dryness. She also suggests amazing quality cremes/products that make a huge difference on the long term for my face! Thank you again Cindy!",
        "time": 1704561844,
        "translated": false
      }
